{"arm": "vs", "model": "openai/gpt-6-luna", "i": 4, "finish": "stop", "dirs": [{"direction": "Warm editorial: cream paper, expressive serif typography, hand-drawn tidepool motifs, and a calm weekly-planning story.", "probability": 0.28}, {"direction": "Bright SaaS: crisp white canvas, confident blue accents, a polished product dashboard, and clear conversion-focused sections.", "probability": 0.24}, {"direction": "Playful studio: vivid coral and teal, oversized type, quirky illustrations, and a lively collaborative feel.", "probability": 0.18}, {"direction": "Quiet minimal: generous whitespace, restrained monochrome, precise typography, and a focused view of the planning workflow.", "probability": 0.17}, {"direction": "Coastal dark mode: deep ocean colors, luminous aqua details, and atmospheric visuals that make the product feel immersive.", "probability": 0.13}], "pick": {"direction": "Warm editorial: cream paper, expressive serif typography, hand-drawn tidepool motifs, and a calm weekly-planning story.", "probability": 0.28}, "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f6f3ea\">\n  <title>Tidepool \u2014 Make a week that works</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --paper: #f6f3ea;\n      --paper-deep: #eee9dc;\n      --ink: #203c35;\n      --muted: #66736b;\n      --line: #dedbcf;\n      --coral: #dc765e;\n      --coral-pale: #f4e1d8;\n      --blue: #8ba9a5;\n      --blue-pale: #e4ece7;\n      --yellow: #e6c576;\n      --white: #fffdf7;\n      --serif: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 8% 14%, rgba(210, 197, 166, .12), transparent 35%),\n        var(--paper);\n      font-family: var(--sans);\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n\n    .page-shell {\n      width: min(1200px, calc(100% - 64px));\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .topbar {\n      height: 88px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(32, 60, 53, .13);\n    }\n\n    .brand {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 11px;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 25px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: -.8px;\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark {\n      width: 34px;\n      height: 34px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .nav-links {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 35px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: #4e625a;\n    }\n\n    .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta):hover { color: var(--coral); }\n\n    .nav-cta {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 11px 17px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--ink);\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      transition: .2s ease;\n    }\n\n    .nav-cta:hover {\n      color: var(--paper);\n      background: var(--ink);\n    }\n\n    .hero {\n      min-height: 644px;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: .92fr 1.08fr;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 40px;\n      padding: 64px 0 75px;\n    }\n\n    .hero-copy { max-width: 500px; }\n\n    .eyebrow {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 9px;\n      margin: 0 0 23px;\n      color: #68776d;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 1.45px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .eyebrow-mark {\n      width: 24px;\n      height: 1px;\n      background: var(--coral);\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0;\n      max-width: 540px;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: clamp(56px, 6.2vw, 82px);\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: -4px;\n      line-height: .99;\n    }\n\n    h1 em {\n      color: var(--coral);\n      font-weight: 400;\n    }\n\n    .hero-description {\n      max-width: 395px;\n      margin: 27px 0 29px;\n      color: #64716a;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.75;\n    }\n\n    .hero-actions {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 19px;\n    }\n\n    .button {\n      min-height: 48px;\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 0 21px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--ink);\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--ink);\n      color: var(--white);\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      transition: transform .2s ease, background .2s ease;\n    }\n\n    .button:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-2px);\n      background: #31564b;\n    }\n\n    .quiet-link {\n      color: #53645b;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #aeb8ab;\n      padding-bottom: 3px;\n    }\n\n    .quiet-link:hover { color: var(--coral); }\n\n    .social-proof {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 12px;\n      margin-top: 35px;\n      color: #788179;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n\n    .avatar-stack { display: flex; padding-left: 3px; }\n\n    .avatar {\n      width: 25px;\n      height: 25px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      margin-left: -4px;\n      border: 2px solid var(--paper);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .avatar:nth-child(1) { background: #bc795d; }\n    .avatar:nth-child(2) { background: #718c7d; }\n    .avatar:nth-child(3) { background: #c0a35f; }\n    .avatar:nth-child(4) { background: #8b8995; }\n\n    .hero-art {\n      position: relative;\n      min-height: 484px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .art-wash {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 455px;\n      height: 410px;\n      border-radius: 49% 51% 42% 58% / 50% 39% 61% 50%;\n      background: #e9eee5;\n      transform: rotate(-8deg);\n    }\n\n    .plan-card {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      width: min(100%, 480px);\n      padding: 25px 25px 21px;\n      border: 1px solid #e5e1d5;\n      border-radius: 5px;\n      background: var(--white);\n      box-shadow: 0 24px 50px rgba(45, 62, 51, .12), 0 3px 9px rgba(45, 62, 51, .05);\n      transform: rotate(1deg);\n    }\n\n    .plan-head {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding-bottom: 19px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #ebe8df;\n    }\n\n    .plan-kicker {\n      margin: 0 0 5px;\n      color: #8b9288;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 1.3px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .plan-head h2 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 25px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: -.5px;\n    }\n\n    .week-label {\n      margin-top: 4px;\n      padding: 7px 10px;\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      background: #f2f0e8;\n      color: #69746b;\n      font-size: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .day-head,\n    .plan-row {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 112px repeat(5, 1fr);\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .day-head {\n      height: 40px;\n      color: #8d948b;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: .5px;\n      text-align: center;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .day-head span:first-child { text-align: left; }\n\n    .plan-row {\n      min-height: 62px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #efede6;\n    }\n\n    .person {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      color: #46594f;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .person-dot {\n      width: 23px;\n      height: 23px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: var(--blue-pale);\n      color: #4f7669;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n\n    .plan-row:nth-of-type(4) .person-dot { background: var(--coral-pale); color: #a45c48; }\n    .plan-row:nth-of-type(5) .person-dot { background: #f3ecd5; color: #8b7744; }\n\n    .cell {\n      min-height: 31px;\n      margin: 0 2px;\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      background: #f4f2eb;\n    }\n\n    .task {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      min-height: 31px;\n      padding: 0 8px;\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .task.moss { background: #e2ebe2; color: #466a57; }\n    .task.rose { background: #f5e4db; color: #9f5d4b; }\n    .task.sand { background: #f3ecd5; color: #89743f; }\n    .task.blue { background: #e4ecec; color: #547574; }\n\n    .span-2 { grid-column: span 2; }\n    .span-3 { grid-column: span 3; }\n\n    .plan-foot {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding-top: 16px;\n      color: #879087;\n      font-size: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .plan-foot strong {\n      color: #60786a;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .scribble-note {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 2;\n      right: -1px;\n      bottom: 2px;\n      color: #bc6f58;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-style: italic;\n      transform: rotate(-9deg);\n    }\n\n    .scribble-note svg {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 68px;\n      bottom: 15px;\n      width: 72px;\n      height: 35px;\n      overflow: visible;\n    }\n\n    .floating-note {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 2;\n      top: 4px;\n      left: -8px;\n      padding: 11px 14px;\n      border: 1px solid #e4ddcd;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      background: #fffaf0;\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(55, 61, 48, .08);\n      color: #68756a;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-style: italic;\n      transform: rotate(-6deg);\n    }\n\n    .tidepool-doodle {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: -5px;\n      top: -2px;\n      width: 118px;\n      height: 110px;\n      z-index: 0;\n      transform: rotate(9deg);\n    }\n\n    .feature-band {\n      border-top: 1px solid rgba(32, 60, 53, .14);\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(32, 60, 53, .14);\n      background: rgba(236, 233, 221, .48);\n    }\n\n    .features {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      padding: 27px 0;\n    }\n\n    .feature {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 14px;\n      padding: 0 27px;\n      border-right: 1px solid rgba(32, 60, 53, .13);\n    }\n\n    .feature:first-child { padding-left: 0; }\n    .feature:last-child { border: 0; }\n\n    .feature-icon {\n      width: 39px;\n      height: 39px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n      border: 1px solid #d8d8c9;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: #648275;\n    }\n\n    .feature strong {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: 3px;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n    }\n\n    .feature span {\n      color: #7a8279;\n      font-size: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .story {\n      position: relative;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr;\n      gap: 80px;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 101px 0 108px;\n    }\n\n    .story-label {\n      margin: 0 0 17px;\n      color: #9a725d;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 1.4px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .story h2 {\n      max-width: 400px;\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: clamp(37px, 4.3vw, 53px);\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: -2px;\n      line-height: 1.08;\n    }\n\n    .story-copy {\n      max-width: 470px;\n      color: #657168;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.85;\n    }\n\n    .story-copy p { margin: 0 0 17px; }\n\n    .story-copy a {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      margin-top: 3px;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .story-copy a:hover { color: var(--coral); }\n\n    .closing {\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      padding: 62px 30px 66px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      background: #e7ece3;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .closing::before,\n    .closing::after {\n      position: absolute;\n      content: \"\";\n      width: 220px;\n      height: 220px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(85, 121, 102, .2);\n      border-radius: 45% 55% 63% 37% / 46% 37% 63% 54%;\n      transform: rotate(35deg);\n    }\n\n    .closing::before { left: -96px; top: -130px; }\n    .closing::after { right: -85px; bottom: -148px; }\n\n    .closing .eyebrow {\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin-bottom: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .closing h2 {\n      margin: 0 auto 13px;\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: clamp(37px, 4vw, 51px);\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: -1.8px;\n    }\n\n    .closing p {\n      margin: 0 auto 23px;\n      color: #69776c;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .closing .button { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n\n    footer {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 27px 0 30px;\n      color: #899087;\n      font-size: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 22px; }\n    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }\n\n    @media (max-width: 850px) {\n      .page-shell { width: min(100% - 40px, 660px); }\n      .hero {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        gap: 12px;\n        padding: 59px 0 54px;\n      }\n      .hero-copy { max-width: 580px; }\n      .hero-art { min-height: 460px; }\n      .art-wash { width: 90%; }\n      .story { gap: 35px; }\n      .feature { padding: 0 15px; }\n      .feature-icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 600px) {\n      .page-shell { width: calc(100% - 36px); }\n      .topbar { height: 72px; }\n      .brand { font-size: 22px; }\n      .nav-links { gap: 0; }\n      .nav-links > a:not(.nav-cta) { display: none; }\n      .nav-cta { padding: 9px 13px; font-size: 11px; }\n      .hero { padding-top: 48px; }\n      h1 { font-size: clamp(53px, 15vw, 73px); letter-spacing: -3px; }\n      .hero-description { font-size: 14px; }\n      .hero-art { min-height: 385px; margin: 10px -8px 0; }\n      .art-wash { height: 330px; }\n      .plan-card { padding: 18px 14px 15px; }\n      .plan-head h2 { font-size: 21px; }\n      .day-head, .plan-row { grid-template-columns: 83px repeat(5, 1fr); }\n      .person { gap: 5px; font-size: 9px; }\n      .person-dot { width: 20px; height: 20px; }\n      .day-head { font-size: 8px; }\n      .task { padding: 0 5px; font-size: 8px; }\n      .cell { margin: 0 1px; }\n      .floating-note { left: 0; top: -7px; font-size: 11px; }\n      .tidepool-doodle { right: -8px; width: 90px; }\n      .scribble-note { right: 3px; bottom: -5px; font-size: 13px; }\n      .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 8px 0; }\n      .feature {\n        padding: 13px 0;\n        border-right: 0;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(32, 60, 53, .12);\n      }\n      .feature:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n      .story {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        gap: 20px;\n        padding: 68px 0 71px;\n      }\n      .story h2 { font-size: 43px; }\n      .story-copy { font-size: 13px; }\n      .closing { padding: 49px 18px 52px; }\n      footer { align-items: flex-start; gap: 18px; flex-direction: column; }\n    }\n\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }\n      *, *::before, *::after { transition-duration: .01ms !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page-shell\">\n    <header class=\"topbar\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Tidepool home\">\n        <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" fill=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M5 22c4-8 9-12 15-12s11 4 15 12c-4 7-9 10-15 10S9 29 5 22Z\" stroke=\"#31594d\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10 22c3-4 6-6 10-6s7 2 10 6c-3 4-6 6-10 6s-7-2-10-6Z\" stroke=\"#dc765e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"22\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#31594d\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </span>\n        Tidepool\n      </a>\n      <nav class=\"nav-links\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n        <a href=\"#how-it-works\">How it works</a>\n        <a href=\"#about\">Our approach</a>\n        <a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"#get-started\">Plan a week <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></a>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <main>\n      <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n        <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-mark\"></span> A little more room to think</p>\n          <h1 id=\"hero-title\">Make a week<br>that <em>works</em><br>for everyone.</h1>\n          <p class=\"hero-description\">\n            Tidepool is a gentler way for small teams to plan together.\n            Find your rhythm, make space for the important things, and\n            leave the week feeling a little lighter.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n            <a class=\"button\" href=\"#get-started\">Start planning <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></a>\n            <a class=\"quiet-link\" href=\"#how-it-works\">Take a little look</a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"social-proof\">\n            <div class=\"avatar-stack\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <span class=\"avatar\">J</span>\n              <span class=\"avatar\">M</span>\n              <span class=\"avatar\">A</span>\n              <span class=\"avatar\">L</span>\n            </div>\n            <span>Made for small teams with big ideas</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hero-art\" aria-label=\"A preview of a team's shared weekly plan\">\n          <div class=\"art-wash\"></div>\n\n          <div class=\"floating-note\">a week with a little breathing room</div>\n\n          <svg class=\"tidepool-doodle\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 110\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M60 94C53 77 45 65 30 55M60 94c3-20 10-35 24-50M60 94c-8-10-15-15-28-18M60 94c12-12 23-17 39-19\" stroke=\"#668779\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M29 55c-9-6-9-15-4-18 7-4 12 4 4 18ZM84 44c-1-10 5-16 10-13 6 4 1 12-10 13ZM32 76c-11 1-17-5-14-10 4-6 12-2 14 10ZM99 75c9-6 17-3 16 3-1 7-10 7-16-3Z\" stroke=\"#668779\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"61\" cy=\"95\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#dc765e\"/>\n            <path d=\"M44 36c5-5 9-7 14-7M53 24c4-4 8-5 13-5\" stroke=\"#dc765e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n\n          <div class=\"plan-card\">\n            <div class=\"plan-head\">\n              <div>\n                <p class=\"plan-kicker\">The week ahead</p>\n                <h2>Good things, in good time.</h2>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"week-label\">May 12 \u2013 16 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2304</span></span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"day-head\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <span>Our people</span>\n              <span>Mon</span><span>Tue</span><span>Wed</span><span>Thu</span><span>Fri</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"plan-row\">\n              <div class=\"person\"><span class=\"person-dot\">J</span> Jules</div>\n              <div class=\"task moss span-2\">Focus time</div>\n              <div class=\"cell\"></div>\n              <div class=\"task sand span-2\">Share the first draft</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"plan-row\">\n              <div class=\"person\"><span class=\"person-dot\">M</span> Morgan</div>\n              <div class=\"cell\"></div>\n              <div class=\"task rose span-2\">Studio check-in</div>\n              <div class=\"task blue span-2\">Make it real</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"plan-row\">\n              <div class=\"person\"><span class=\"person-dot\">A</span> Alex</div>\n              <div class=\"task blue span-2\">Talk to customers</div>\n              <div class=\"cell\"></div>\n              <div class=\"task moss span-2\">Quiet work</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"plan-row\">\n              <div class=\"person\"><span class=\"person-dot\">L</span> Lee</div>\n              <div class=\"cell\"></div>\n              <div class=\"task sand span-2\">Sketching ideas</div>\n              <div class=\"cell\"></div>\n              <div class=\"task rose\">Wrap-up</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"plan-foot\">\n              <span>4 people <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u00b7</span> 12 things in motion</span>\n              <strong>Looking good \u2713</strong>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"scribble-note\">\n            room for the<br>unexpected, too\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 72 35\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path d=\"M2 8c24 2 36 8 51 19M44 19l10 8 3-11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#bc6f58\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"feature-band\" id=\"how-it-works\" aria-label=\"What Tidepool helps you do\">\n        <div class=\"features\">\n          <div class=\"feature\">\n            <span class=\"feature-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <rect x=\"4\" y=\"5\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n                <path d=\"M8 3v4M16 3v4M4 10h16M8 14h3M8 17h6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <div><strong>See the whole week</strong><span>One shared view, less guesswork.</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature\">\n            <span class=\"feature-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M4 16c3-4 5-5 8-5s5 1 8 5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                <path d=\"M6 18c2-2 4-3 6-3s4 1 6 3M12 4v3M5 7l2 2M19 7l-2 2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <div><strong>Make space for focus</strong><span>Protect the time that matters.</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature\">\n            <span class=\"feature-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M5 12c2-3 4-4 7-4s5 1 7 4c-2 3-4 4-7 4s-5-1-7-4Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.7\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n                <path d=\"M3 19c2-1 3-1 5 0s3 1 5 0 3-1 5 0 3 1 4 0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <div><strong>Adjust as you go</strong><span>Plans that bend with real life.</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"story\" id=\"about\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"story-label\">A calmer kind of planning</p>\n          <h2>Good weeks aren\u2019t packed. They\u2019re considered.</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"story-copy\">\n          <p>\n            The best plans leave room for people to be people. Tidepool brings\n            your team\u2019s priorities, capacity, and little moving pieces together\n            in one easy place.\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            No color-coded chaos. No pretending every Tuesday goes to plan.\n            Just a thoughtful starting point for doing good work, together.\n          </p>\n          <a href=\"#get-started\">A bit more about Tidepool <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span></a>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"closing\" id=\"get-started\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-mark\"></span> Find your team\u2019s tide <span class=\"eyebrow-mark\"></span></p>\n        <h2>Start with a simpler Monday.</h2>\n        <p>Bring your people. We\u2019ll bring a little breathing room.</p>\n        <a class=\"button\" href=\"mailto:hello@tidepool.team\">Make your first plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></a>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer>\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Tidepool home\">\n        <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M5 22c4-8 9-12 15-12s11 4 15 12c-4 7-9 10-15 10S9 29 5 22Z\" stroke=\"#31594d\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10 22c3-4 6-6 10-6s7 2 10 6c-3 4-6 6-10 6s-7-2-10-6Z\" stroke=\"#dc765e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"22\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#31594d\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </span>\n        Tidepool\n      </a>\n      <span>Made for the way work really works. \u00a9 2025 Tidepool</span>\n      <div class=\"footer-links\">\n        <a href=\"mailto:hello@tidepool.team\">Say hello</a>\n        <a href=\"#about\">Our approach</a>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}